# Hidden features (recover, do not recreate)

These are **hidden, not deleted**. If the user says recover / show / bring back any of them, flip the flag. Do not rebuild markup, data, or assets.

## Teahouse project card

- Flag: `CONFIG.showTeahouse` in `js/config.js` (currently `false`)
- Card stays in `index.html` (`#cardTeahouse`), plus `js/data/projects.js` and i18n
- CSS: `body.hide-teahouse #cardTeahouse` in `css/layout.css`
- Visible card list: `visibleProjectCards()` in `js/modules/tabs.js`

**Recover Teahouse:** set `showTeahouse: true`, bump `config.js` cache query on the `main.js` import (and `tabs.js` if it imports config). Reload. Do not copy a new card.

## Other hide-in-place flags

- Desktop nav / team screen: `CONFIG.showNav` (`false`) — team cards and desktop tabs stay in the DOM
- Phone pill: `CONFIG.showMobileNav` (`false`) — pills stay in the DOM. CSS: `body.hide-mobile-nav .mobile-tab-bar`
- Social row: `CONFIG.showSocial`
- Phone + GitHub icons: CSS `.social-phone` / `.social-github` (`display: none`); keep the links
- Instagram icon: CSS `.social-instagram` (`display: none`); keep the links. Circular cluster `.social-icons-mobile` is also hidden while every icon inside is off; restore the row when bringing any icon back.
- Telegram icon: CSS `.social-telegram` (`display: none`); keep the links. Desktop Contact button opens Telegram.
- Sound: `CONFIG.showSound` (`false`) — speaker button stays in `index.html`, `js/modules/audio.js` stays. Playback is skipped while the flag is off.
- Contact form: `CONFIG.showForm` (`false`) — `#contactSection` stays in the DOM. CSS: `body.hide-form #contactSection`.
- Bottom studio copy: `CONFIG.showFooterCopy` (`true`) — `#studioCopy` stays in the DOM. CSS: `body.hide-footer-copy #studioCopy` at `min-width: 861px`. Right-side about and extra service lines stay hidden.

**Recover sound:** set `showSound: true`, bump `config.js` cache on the `main.js` import. Reload.

**Recover desktop form:** set `showForm: true`, bump `config.js` cache on the `main.js` import. Reload.

**Recover phone nav:** set `showMobileNav: true`, bump `config.js` cache on the `main.js` import. Reload.

**Recover bottom copy:** set `showFooterCopy: true`, bump `config.js` cache on the `main.js` import. Reload.

Bump the matching `?v=` on `js/main.js` and CSS after a flag change so the browser does not keep the old file.
